<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>गीता पुस्तकालय</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="master.css">
<style>
  /* TEST ONLY: Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit — forced here, not added to master.css */
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit';
    src: url('fonts/TiroDevanagariSanskrit-Regular.ttf') format('truetype');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit';
    src: url('fonts/TiroDevanagariSanskrit-Italic.ttf') format('truetype');
    font-weight: normal;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  :root {
    --ink:#231f20; --rule:#e8ddc8; --bg:#faf7f0; --accent:#a51512; --accent2:#1066b1; --gold:#c45911;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body, body * {
    font-family: 'Tiro Devanagari Sanskrit', 'ChanakyaUni', Georgia, serif !important;
  }
  body {
    margin:0; padding:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink);
  }
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, #7a0f0d 100%);
    color:#fff; padding:1.5rem 1rem; text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  header h1 { margin:0 0 .3rem 0; font-size:2rem; }
  header p { margin:0; opacity:0.9; font-size:0.95rem; }
  .search-wrap { max-width:600px; margin:1rem auto 0 auto; padding:0 1rem; }
  #search {
    width:100%; padding:0.7rem 1rem; border-radius:24px; border:none;
    font-size:1rem; font-family:inherit; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  nav.tabs {
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; justify-content:center;
    padding:1rem; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  nav.tabs button {
    border:1px solid var(--rule); background:#fff; color:var(--ink);
    padding:0.5rem 1rem; border-radius:20px; cursor:pointer; font-size:0.9rem;
    font-family:inherit; transition:all .15s;
  }
  nav.tabs button.active { background:var(--accent); color:#fff; border-color:var(--accent); }
  nav.tabs button .cnt { opacity:0.7; font-size:0.8em; margin-left:0.3em; }
  main { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 1rem 3rem 1rem; }
  .cat-heading { color:var(--gold); border-bottom:2px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom:0.4rem; margin:1.5rem 0 1rem 0; }
  .letter-group { margin-bottom:1.2rem; }
  .letter-group h3 { color:var(--accent2); font-size:1rem; margin:0 0 0.4rem 0; }
  ul.book-list { list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:0.4rem 1rem; }
  ul.book-list li a {
    color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; display:block; padding:0.35rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius:6px; font-size:1.15rem;
  }
  ul.book-list li a:hover { background:#f0e6d2; color:var(--accent); }
  ul.book-list li .author { display:block; font-size:0.78rem; color:#8a7f6a; margin-top:-0.1rem; }
  ul.book-list li a:hover .author { color:var(--accent); opacity:0.85; }
  .empty-msg { text-align:center; padding:2rem; color:#888; }
  .count-badge { color:#888; font-size:0.85rem; margin-left:0.5rem; }
  footer { text-align:center; padding:1.5rem; color:#999; font-size:0.85rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>गीता पुस्तकालय</h1>
  <p>गीता प्रेस के मूल ग्रंथ — सरल एवं सुगम पठन के लिए नवीन प्रस्तुति।</p>
</header>
<div class="search-wrap">
  <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="पुस्तक खोजें... (search books)">
</div>
<nav class="tabs" id="tabs"></nav>
<main id="main"></main>
<footer>कुल ग्रंथ / Total books: <span id="totalCount"></span></footer>

